{"body": {"incomplete_results": false, "items": [{"active_lock_reason": null, "assignee": null, "assignees": [], "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR", "body": "I noticed this when working on https://github.com/astral-sh/uv/pull/16697.\r\n\r\n[PEP\u202f639](https://peps.python.org/pep-0639/#add-license-files-key) expects tools to ship license texts as UTF\u20118, but previously `uv build` would quietly include any binary blob listed under `project.license-files`.\r\n\r\nI have no clue what is going on with `rustfmt` for this file, but it seems that when I add the check, it wants to reformat a bunch of surrounding stuff.\r\n\r\nThe relevant part to look at is:\r\n\r\n```rust\r\nfor license_file in &license_files {\r\n    let file_path = root.join(license_file);\r\n    let bytes = fs_err::read(&file_path)?;\r\n    if str::from_utf8(&bytes).is_err() {\r\n        return Err(ValidationError::LicenseFileNotUtf8(license_file.clone()).into());\r\n    }\r\n}\r\n```\r\n\r\nwhere we validate all collected license files before proceeding.", "closed_at": "2025-11-13T12:50:00Z", "comments": 1, "comments_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/astral-sh/uv/issues/16699/comments", "created_at": "2025-11-12T03:44:34Z", "draft": false, "events_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/astral-sh/uv/issues/16699/events", "html_url": "https://github.com/astral-sh/uv/pull/16699", "id": 3614758890, "issue_field_values": [], "labels": [{"archived_at": null, "archived_by": null, "color": "D4C5F9", "default": true, "description": "New feature or improvement to existing functionality", "id": 6034754233, "name": "enhancement", "node_id": "LA_kwDOKbIFZc8AAAABZ7MKuQ", "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/astral-sh/uv/labels/enhancement"}], "labels_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/astral-sh/uv/issues/16699/labels{/name}", "locked": false, "milestone": null, "node_id": "PR_kwDOKbIFZc6y4xUs", "number": 16699, "performed_via_github_app": null, "pull_request": {"diff_url": "https://github.com/astral-sh/uv/pul