ieb/orgs", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/zanieb/received_events", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/zanieb/repos", "site_admin": false, "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/zanieb/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/zanieb/subscriptions", "type": "User", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/zanieb", "user_view_type": "public"}], "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR", "body": "Resolves https://github.com/astral-sh/uv/issues/15665\r\n\r\n`uv tool upgrade` already respects version pins, but when a tool was installed with an exact version the command quietly becomes a no-op even though users expect it to upgrade the executable. This change tweaks the upgrade flow to detect that situation by inspecting the stored receipt and, whenever the tool stays pinned, emit a concise hint explaining why the version didn\u2019t move and how to reinstall without the pin. \r\n\r\nThe message still appears if the run only refreshed supporting packages, so users aren\u2019t misled by dependency churn that leaves the tool itself untouched. \r\n\r\nI also added an integration test for the scenario end to end by installing `babel==2.6.0`, attempting an upgrade, and asserting that the hint is shown alongside the dependency updates.\r\n", "closed_at": "2025-10-07T16:18:40Z", "comments": 0, "comments_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/astral-sh/uv/issues/16081/comments", "created_at": "2025-10-01T01:26:49Z", "draft": false, "events_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/astral-sh/uv/issues/16081/events", "html_url": "https://github.com/astral-sh/uv/pull/16081", "id": 3471636359, "issue_field_values": [], "labels": [], "labels_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/astral-sh/uv/issues/16081/labels{/name}", "locked": false, "milestone": null, "node_id": "PR_kwDOKbIFZc6rdDnQ", "number": 16081, "performed_via_github_app": null, "pull_request": {"diff_url": "https://github.com/astral-sh/uv/pull/16081.diff", "html_url": "https://github.com/astral-sh/uv/pull/16081", "merged_at": "2025-10-07T16:18:40Z", "patch_url": "https://github.com/astral-sh/uv/pull/16081.patch", "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/astral-sh/uv/pulls/16081"}, "reactions": {"+1": 0, "-1": 0, "confused": 0, "eyes": 0, "heart": 0, "hooray": 0, "laugh": 0, "rocket": 0, "total_count": 0, "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/astral-sh/uv/issues/16081/reactions"}, "repository_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/astral-sh/uv", "score": 1.0, "state": "closed", "state_reason": null, "timeline_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/astral-sh/uv/issues/16081/timeline", "title": "Surface pinned-version hint when `uv tool upgrade` can\u2019t move the tool", "type": null, "updated_at": "2025-10-07T16:18:40Z", "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/astral-sh/uv/issues/16081", "user": {"avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/31192478?v=4", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/terror/events{/privacy}", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/terror/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/terror/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/terror/gists{/gist_id}", "gravatar_id": "", "html_url": "https://github.com/terror", "id": 31192478, "login": "terror", "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjMxMTkyNDc4", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/terror/orgs", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/terror/received_events", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/terror/repos", "site_admin": false, "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/terror/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/terror/subscriptions", "type": "User", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/terror", "user_view_type": "public"}}, {"active_lock_reason": null, "assignee": null, "assignees": [], "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR", "body": "Resolves https://github.com/astral-sh/uv/issues/16067\r\n\r\nWhen we build the dependency graph we add an edge per `Requires-Dist`. If a package publishes multiple marker-guarded requirements (like pylint\u2019s `dill>=\u2026` for different Python versions), more than one marker can evaluate to true at runtime, which gives us several edges pointing to the same installed package node.\r\n\r\nTo avoid printing the package multiple times, we gather all edges targeting that node, pass them through a `Cursor`, and aggregate their requirement details before we print the dependency line. That aggregation does two things:\r\n  1. If any edge carries a URL, we return that URL immediately.\r\n  2. Otherwise we merge all version specifiers into one canonical PEP\u202f440 string.\r\n\r\nI've added an integration test, namely `cargo test -p uv --test it --features pypi -- no_duplicate_dependencies_with_markers` exercises the new snapshot that installs pylint (with the real dill duplication scenario present in the original issue) and asserts the tree output, both with and without `--show-version-specifiers`, now shows a single dill entry with the merged constraint.", "closed_at": "2025-10-01T16:01:42Z", "comments": 1, "comments_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/astral-sh/uv/issues/16078/comments", "created_at": "2025-09-30T18:59:52Z", "draft": false, "events_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/astral-sh/uv/issues/16078/events", "html_url": "https://github.com/astral-sh/uv/pull/16078", "id": 3470706762, "issue_field_values": [], "labels": [], "labels_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/astral-sh/uv/issues/16078/labels{/name}", "locked": false, "milestone": null, "node_id": "PR_kwDOKbIFZc6rZ3nb", "number": 16078, "performed_via_github_app": null, "pull_request": {"diff_url": "https://github.com/astral-sh/uv/pull/16078.diff", "html_url": "https://github.com/astral-sh/uv/pull/16078", "merged_at": "2025-10-01T16:01:42Z", "patch_url": "https://github.com/astral-sh/uv/pull/16078.patch", "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/astral-sh/uv/pulls/16078"}, "reactions": {"+1": 0, "-1": 0, "confused": 0, "eye